_KEY2 = [("A1. What are the three holidays mentioned?", "Christmas, New Year and the Day of the Dead (All Saints’ Day; the book’s key also writes All Souls’ Day)."), ("A2. Describe Christmas in the Philippines.", "It is the longest Christmas celebration: from September to December; plenty of gifts for family and godchildren; beautiful lanterns; families go to church together on Christmas Day; the Noche Buena dinner."), ("A3. Two descriptions of New Year’s Day.", "The fireworks are fun; different types of firecrackers are sold."), ("A4. Three things to do on All Saints’ Day.", "Any of: family bonding, eating, chatting and telling stories, singing, going to the cemetery together."), ("B. What were the four questions about?", "If someone will watch the house later today; if the son is going somewhere; if someone is coming to prepare for Noche Buena; if someone has already invited the Mayor to the party tomorrow.")]
